IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P6-art-51-52`
IMPORT `P6-annex-xi-xiii`

-- P6-tests-annex-xi-xiii: tests of Annexes XI, XII and XIII, written from the text.
-- The expected value of each assertion was decided from the text of the Annex (a required item missing is JUST FALSE; an item "where applicable" is required only when it applies), by
-- work/gen_annex_tests.py, and not read back from the encoding. The gate is Chapter V's group (2 August 2025) and Art 111(3) (a model placed before 2 August 2025: 2 August 2027).
-- The argument order of each function is stated above its group of assertions: two BOOLEAN arguments swapped would still type-check.

§ `Dates and models used in the tests`

`Annex test the day before the group applies` MEANS Date 1 8 2025
`Annex test a later day` MEANS Date 1 3 2026
`Annex test the day before the legacy time ends` MEANS Date 1 8 2027
`Annex test the first day of the legacy time` MEANS Date 2 8 2027

-- A model placed on the market on 3 August 2025, after the group begins to apply.
`Annex test model` MEANS `AI model` WITH
    `date placed on the market` IS Date 3 8 2025
    `cumulative compute used for its training, in floating-point operations` IS 10_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_001

-- A model placed on the market on 1 August 2025: Art 111(3) gives its provider until 2 August 2027.
`Annex test legacy model` MEANS `AI model` WITH
    `date placed on the market` IS Date 1 8 2025
    `cumulative compute used for its training, in floating-point operations` IS 10_000_000_000_000_000_000_000_001

§ `Annexes XI, XII and XIII: the content of the documentation, the information, and the criteria`

-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, then items (a) to (f)
#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 1 the general description of the model contains the information` `Annex test a later day` `Annex test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 1 the general description of the model contains the information` `Annex test a later day` `Annex test model` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 1 the general description of the model contains the information` `Annex test a later day` `Annex test model` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 1 the general description of the model contains the information` `Annex test a later day` `Annex test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 1 the general description of the model contains the information` `Annex test a later day` `Annex test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 1 the general description of the model contains the information` `Annex test a later day` `Annex test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 1 the general description of the model contains the information` `Annex test a later day` `Annex test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 1 the general description of the model contains the information` `Annex test the day before the group applies` `Annex test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 1 the general description of the model contains the information` `Annex test a later day` `Annex test model` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 1 the general description of the model contains the information` `Annex test a later day` `Annex test legacy model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 1 the general description of the model contains the information` `Annex test the day before the legacy time ends` `Annex test legacy model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 1 the general description of the model contains the information` `Annex test the first day of the legacy time` `Annex test legacy model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- args: date asked, model, general-purpose AI model, (a), (b), (c) applicable, (c) included, (d), (e) states the known or estimated figure, (e) the figure is unknown, (e) based on computational resources used
-- all items there, the figure for (e) stated
#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 2 the detailed description of the elements and of the process contains the information` `Annex test a later day` `Annex test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a) missing
#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 2 the detailed description of the elements and of the process contains the information` `Annex test a later day` `Annex test model` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b) missing
