#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 2 the detailed description of the elements and of the process contains the information` `Annex test a later day` `Annex test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (e): unknown, and based on information about computational resources used
#ASSERT `Annex XI Section 1 point 2 the detailed description of the elements and of the process contains the information` `Annex test a later day` `Annex test model` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (e): based on computational resources but the figure is not unknown: the sentence after the list does not reach it
