§ `Annex XIII: the duty of the Commission (no time limit and no consequence)`

-- args: date asked, the purpose is to determine equivalence with Article 51(1)(a)
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Annex XIII the Commission's duty to take the criteria into account` `Annex test a later day` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 51 the Commission` DOES `Annex XIII take into account the criteria for the designation of a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk` AT 400
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Annex XIII the Commission's duty to take the criteria into account` `Annex test a later day` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Annex XIII the Commission's duty to take the criteria into account` `Annex test a later day` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Annex XIII the Commission's duty to take the criteria into account` `Annex test the day before the group applies` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
